    "weight_decay": 0.0
  },
  "description": "Graphene 5x5 complete paper-ready train payload. Reuses existing validated iid20/iid50/iid80/iid100/iid150/iid200/iid300/iid400/iid500 datasets and expects iid30/iid60/iid90/iid600/iid800/iid1000 from the missing-datasets payload.",
